<view class="page-shell">
  <canvas
    id="scene"
    type="2d"
    class="scene"
    aria-label="{{canvasLabel}}"
    bindtouchstart="onCanvasStart"
    catchtouchmove="onCanvasMove"
    bindtouchend="onCanvasEnd"
    bindtouchcancel="onCanvasCancel">
  </canvas>

  <view wx:if="{{showNote}}" class="note-paper">
    <view class="note-label">今天又是哪件破事</view>
    <textarea
      class="note-field"
      value="{{note}}"
      maxlength="-1"
      auto-focus="true"
      show-confirm-bar="true"
      placeholder=""
      placeholder-class="placeholder"
      bindinput="onNoteInput">
    </textarea>
    <view class="tag-list" aria-label="选择烦恼分类">
      <view
        wx:for="{{tags}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="tag-item {{selectedTag == item.id ? 'tag-item-active' : ''}}"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="selectTag">
        {{item.label}}
      </view>
    </view>
    <button class="note-next" disabled="{{!canContinue}}" bindtap="finishNote">打包，别留着过夜</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{showResult}}" class="result-overlay">
    <view class="result-card result-tier-{{resultTier}}">
      <view class="result-kicker">本次发疯已妥善处理</view>
      <view class="result-title">{{resultTitle}}</view>
      <view class="result-line">{{resultLine}}</view>
      <view class="result-status">{{resultStatus}}</view>
      <view class="result-summary">{{resultSummary}}</view>
      <view class="result-actions">
        <button class="result-share" open-type="share">发给同样命苦的</button>
        <button class="result-again" bindtap="resetSession">还有一件</button>
      </view>
      <button
        wx:if="{{showRewardAd}}"
        class="reward-button"
        loading="{{rewardBusy}}"
        disabled="{{rewardBusy}}"
        bindtap="watchRewardAd">
        看个视频，再损它一句
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{showPrivacy}}" class="modal-mask" catchtouchmove="preventDefault" bindtap="closePrivacy">
  <view class="privacy-sheet" catchtap="preventDefault">
    <view class="privacy-close" bindtap="closePrivacy">×</view>
    <view>烦恼原文只存在当前页面运行内存中。完成封箱并进入破坏阶段后，原文会立即清空，不上传，也不会写入本机存储。</view>
    <view>本机只保存累计完成过的回收日期，用于计算回收天数和切换结果样式；这些记录不包含原文、姓名、头像、公司或联系方式。</view>
    <view>震动只用于点击和撞击反馈；声音均为小程序内置本地音效，不使用麦克风，也不会录音。</view>
    <view>微信分享只发送固定结果文案和小程序入口，不包含你写下的内容。</view>
    <view>如后续启用微信激励视频，只会在完成回收后由你主动选择观看。</view>
    <view class="muted">这是虚拟解压玩具，不提供心理诊断或治疗。若压力持续影响生活，建议向可信赖的人或专业人士寻求帮助。</view>
  </view>
</view>
